# Ledger 216's guard: an overhang the world made (a ledge of earth 5 out from a hillside, over its strength: earth
# corbels one cell) stays when a blast opens the hillside beside it, because it still hangs on to the hillside.
# Passes on the fix and with BS_OLDWEIGHSPARE=1; a fix that dropped everything "over its strength" would fail it.
#   questcheck --scene quest/scenes/overhang-stays.scene --headset
at 14 150 14
fly on
load 3
ground -10 120 -10 10 175 10 air
ground -8 40 -8 -4 165 8 dirt      # the hillside, from deep in the land
ground -3 160 -1 1 161 1 dirt      # the ledge
expect ground 1 160 0 == true
blast -5 150 5 4                   # into the hillside under and beside the ledge, not through it
tick 3
expect ground -5 150 5 == false    # the blast's hole
expect ground 1 160 0 == true      # the ledge's tip still there
expect ground -3 161 0 == true
